#: ../../guide/troubleshooting.rst:41
msgid "``initialize() has not been called``"
msgstr "``initialize() has not been called``"

#: ../../guide/troubleshooting.rst:42
msgid ""
"The call needs a running CEF. ``add_resource()`` and ``load_url()`` work after ``initialize()``; "
"with :class:`~cefweaver.ui.Session` that is :meth:`~cefweaver.ui.Session.start`, and the browser "
"exists when the view's ``on_ready`` is called (:doc:`cookbook`)."
msgstr ""
"호출에는 실행 중인 CEF가 필요합니다. ``add_resource()``\\ 와 ``load_url()``\\ 은 ``initialize()`` 뒤에 동작합니다. "
":class:`~cefweaver.ui.Session`\\ 에서는 그것이 :meth:`~cefweaver.ui.Session.start`\\ 이며, 브라우저는 뷰의 "
"``on_ready``\\ 가 호출될 때 존재합니다(:doc:`cookbook`)."

#: ../../guide/troubleshooting.rst:43
msgid "``this must be done before initialize()``"
msgstr "``this must be done before initialize()``"

#: ../../guide/troubleshooting.rst:44
msgid ""
"Move the call before ``initialize()`` / ``session.start()``: switches, cache and resource paths, "
"the app handler, JavaScript bindings, ``offscreen`` and the other properties. The same for the "
"settings: ``the settings cannot change after initialize()``. See :doc:`configuration`."
msgstr ""
"호출을 ``initialize()`` / ``session.start()`` 앞으로 옮기십시오. 스위치, 캐시와 리소스 경로, 앱 핸들러, JavaScript 바인딩, "
"``offscreen``, 그 밖의 속성이 해당합니다. 설정도 마찬가지입니다: ``the settings cannot change after initialize()``. "
":doc:`configuration`\\ 을 참고하십시오."

#: ../../guide/troubleshooting.rst:45
msgid "``initialize() was already called``"
msgstr "``initialize() was already called``"

#: ../../guide/troubleshooting.rst:46
msgid "One ``CefApp`` starts once."
msgstr "하나의 ``CefApp``\\ 은 한 번만 시작합니다."

#: ../../guide/troubleshooting.rst:47
msgid "``CEF can be initialized only once per process, and it was shut down already``"
msgstr "``CEF can be initialized only once per process, and it was shut down already``"

